Tokimi's Toolshed for Horizon 26.3 (version 0.4.1)

A port of Tokimi's Toolshed 1.8 by Tokimi, CozyStudios.
Original source: https://github.com/CozyCord/TokimisToolshed
Original licence: CC0-1.0

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: the rules are re-implemented in Rust as a Horizon native mod (the mod API plus
the [[native.mixin]] patches and game modules listed in horizon-mod.toml; no Java code is included), and the
content (items, blocks, textures, models, data) is carried over from the original jar. This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (CC0-1.0); the licence text is in LICENSE. Built
against Horizon's exact-build SDK dd67b76ff23e28c6d8e21859df600d31572f81a0.

LICENSE is the CC0-1.0 text (the jar names CC0-1.0 and has no licence file).
